      key_base       |       key_oid       | enabled |                          hints                          | relnames |    reloids    
---------------------+---------------------+---------+---------------------------------------------------------+----------+---------------
 1110863247016496802 | 5750746670750338341 | t       | NestLoop(t1 t2) IndexScan(t1 t1_v_idx) Leading((t1 t2)) | {t1,t2}  | {79166,79171}
(1 row)

=== Postgres planner, same query, other constant, no comment ===
EXPLAIN (COSTS off) SELECT count(*) FROM t1 JOIN t2 ON t1.id = t2.t1_id WHERE t1.v < 500;
psql:01_capture_apply.sql:18: NOTICE:  gg_planman: applying hints "NestLoop(t1 t2) IndexScan(t1 t1_v_idx) Leading((t1 t2))" id=201 key_base=1110863247016496802 key_oid=5750746670750338341
                             QUERY PLAN                              
---------------------------------------------------------------------
 Finalize Aggregate
   ->  Gather Motion 3:1  (slice1; segments: 3)
         ->  Partial Aggregate
               ->  Nested Loop
                     ->  Broadcast Motion 3:3  (slice2; segments: 3)
                           ->  Index Scan using t1_v_idx on t1
                                 Index Cond: (v < 500)
                     ->  Index Only Scan using t2_t1_id_idx on t2
                           Index Cond: (t1_id = t1.id)
 Optimizer: Postgres-based planner
(10 rows)

